</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：柱體 vs 錐體<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐ 最重要</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>柱體：</strong>兩個底面一模一樣（平行），側面係Rectangle或曲面<br/>
② <strong>錐體：</strong>一個底面 + 一個尖頂（頂點），側面向尖頂收縮<br/>
③ <strong>最易錯：Circle柱 vs Circle錐！</strong>汽水罐 = Circle柱（兩個Circle面）；雪糕筒 = Circle錐（一個Circle面+尖頂）<br/>
④ <strong>Mnemonic：</strong>「柱體兩底面一樣，錐體得一個尖頂！」
</div></div>
<div class="shape-card">
<div class="card">
<div class="name">長方體（柱體）</div>
<svg height="133" viewbox="0 0 230 170" width="180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="70" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3" width="120" x="25" y="35"></rect><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="25,35 45,15 165,15 145,35" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><polygon fill="#BFDBFE" points="145,35 165,15 165,85 145,105" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon></svg>
<div class="props">6 個面（Rectangle）<br/>12 條棱 · 8 個頂點</div>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="name">正方體（柱體）</div>
<svg height="130" viewbox="0 0 210 170" width="160" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="50" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3" width="80" x="25" y="41"></rect><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="25,41 51,15 131,15 105,41" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><polygon fill="#BFDBFE" points="105,41 131,15 131,65 105,91" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon></svg>
<div class="props">6 個面（Square）<br/>12 條棱 · 8 個頂點</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 1：辨認3D Solid</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">以下邊啲係柱體？A. 鞋盒 B. 雪糕筒 C. 汽水罐 D. 金字塔</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">A. 鞋盒 = 長方體（柱體）✓<br/>B. 雪糕筒 = Circle錐（唔係柱體）✗<br/>C. 汽水罐 = Circle柱（柱體）✓<br/>D. 金字塔 = 角錐（唔係柱體）✗<br/>答案：<strong>A 和 C</strong></div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 致命Trap：Circle柱有兩個Circle形底面（一樣大），Circle錐只有一個Circle形底面 + 一個尖頂。唔好搞亂！</div>
<div class="lf-tip">💡 檢查方法：柱體 = 上下兩個面一樣大！錐體 = 上面係一個點（尖頂）！</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>以下哪個係錐體？A. 三角柱 B. 四角錐 C. Circle柱 D. 正方體</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>柱體有幾個底面？它們有咩特點？（相同定唔同？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>寫出 3 樣日常生活見到嘅柱體物件。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：面、棱、頂點<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>面：</strong>3D Solid嘅「皮」，平面或曲面<br/>
② <strong>棱：</strong>兩個面相交嘅「邊線」<br/>
③ <strong>頂點：</strong>三條或以上棱相交嘅「角位」<br/>
④ <strong>數法：</strong>逐個數，唔好漏！用表格記錄！
</div></div>
<table class="props-table">
<tr><th>3D Solid</th><th>面的數量</th><th>棱的數量</th><th>頂點的數量</th></tr>
<tr><td>正方體</td><td>6</td><td>12</td><td>8</td></tr>
<tr><td>長方體</td><td>6</td><td>12</td><td>8</td></tr>
<tr><td>三角柱</td><td class="hl">5</td><td class="hl">9</td><td class="hl">6</td></tr>
<tr><td>四角錐</td><td class="hl">5</td><td class="hl">8</td><td class="hl">5</td></tr>
<tr><td>Circle柱</td><td>3（2平面+1曲面）</td><td>2</td><td>0</td></tr>
<tr><td>Circle錐</td><td>2（1平面+1曲面）</td><td>1</td><td>1</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 2：數面、棱、頂點</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">一個四角錐（金字塔形狀）有幾多個面？幾多條棱？幾多個頂點？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;"><strong>面：</strong>底 = 1 個四邊形，側面 = 4 個Triangle → 共 <strong>5 個面</strong><br/><strong>棱：</strong>底邊 4 條 + 側棱 4 條 → 共 <strong>8 條棱</strong><br/><strong>頂點：</strong>底面 4 個角 + 頂尖 1 個 → 共 <strong>5 個頂點</strong></div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>長方體有幾多條棱？幾多個頂點？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>三角柱有幾多個面？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>Circle柱有幾多個頂點？點解？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>一個3D Solid有 5 個面、8 條棱、5 個頂點。呢個係咩3D Solid？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：3D Solid圖形的分類方法<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>按底面形狀分：</strong>三角（底面係Triangle）、四角（底面係四邊形）、Circle（底面係Circle形）<br/>
② <strong>按柱/錐分：</strong>柱體（兩個底面）、錐體（一個底面+尖頂）<br/>
③ <strong>命名法：</strong>底面形狀 + 柱/錐。例：底面係Triangle + 柱體 = <strong>三角柱</strong>
</div></div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div>
