<tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td>Circle柱和Circle錐最大的分別係咩？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td>正方體所有面都係＿＿形。長方體嘅面係＿＿形。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td>以下哪些係柱體？鞋盒、汽水罐、雪糕筒、鉛筆（六角柱）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
