<tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>一個六角柱有幾多個面？幾多條棱？幾多個頂點？（底面六邊形）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>搵出屋企 3 樣柱體和 2 樣錐體物件，寫低佢哋嘅名同面/棱/頂點數量。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>挑戰：正方體嘅展開圖（cross net）有幾多種唔同嘅排列方式？（提示：有 11 種！你能夠畫出其中 2 種嗎？）</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">六、Common Error Summary （8 min）</div>
<div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ Self Check（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅Trap</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 Learning Objectives Review — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有Trap類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error</th><th>Correct Approach</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Circle柱當成Circle錐</strong></td><td>Circle柱=兩個Circle面；Circle錐=一個Circle面+尖頂</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><strong>數棱或頂點時數漏</strong></td><td>逐個數，用表格記錄，數完再檢查</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><strong>面和曲面唔識分</strong></td><td>平面=平嘅；曲面=彎嘅（例如汽水罐側面）</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><strong>正方體和長方體搞亂</strong></td><td>正方體全部面係Square；長方體可以有Rectangle面</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><strong>角柱和角錐命名搞亂</strong></td><td>底面形狀+柱/錐（三角柱、四角錐...）</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><strong>柱體只有一個底面（錯）</strong></td><td>柱體有兩個相同嘅底面！錐體先得一個！</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><strong>棱和頂點數量關係唔理解</strong></td><td>多面體: V - E + F = 2（歐拉公式，P3簡單版）</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic一：「柱體兩底一樣大，錐體一底一尖頂；Circle柱汽水罐記實，Circle錐雪糕筒分清！」</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic二：「面係皮、棱係邊、頂點係角位；正方長方都 6 面 12 棱 8 頂點！」</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">①</div><div class="t">睇底面</div><div class="d">幾個底面？咩形狀？</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">②</div><div class="t">睇頂部</div><div class="d">平面定尖頂？</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">③</div><div class="t">分類</div><div class="d">柱體定錐體？</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">④</div><div class="t">數特徵</div><div class="d">面、棱、頂點</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-tip" style="text-align:center;font-size:14px;">🌟 3D Solid圖形無處不在！由你嘅鉛筆盒到成座大廈都係3D Solid！你係3D Solid小偵探，到處發掘3D Solid嘅秘密！🔍📦</div>
